# game data: Deimos (D24) and Ferazel (D26) are committed under Resources/; the other games' data stays local.
# Archive mirrors and decompiles are never committed.
/Resources/*
!/Resources/Deimos/
!/Resources/Ferazel/
/Resources/Deimos/Data/HID.bundle/
/Resources/Deimos/**/Icon?
/ghidra/*
!/ghidra/*.py
!/ghidra/*.java
/out/
.build/
.swiftpm/
*.xcodeproj
DerivedData/
.DS_Store
!/ghidra/*.sh
!/ghidra/README.md
